 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hnTWJNcO0mAQ7kNvwGfejgg&_nc_oc=AdojT0qTAG63t1V0Be0x4PFENgLx4IuKWFAOz-RB7UNl5FRGA9dBQvVYcK1YLYFrNvc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMtkUuYHdM5E5HfLQ50ZNzfOlqe4FkZBHkjYxhWhKl2Jw&oe=6AE21241"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gQpclQDI61oQ7kNvwFDr1uZ&_nc_oc=Adrcmm3PLrJxBMOHl0DxKatLDAFjbDWtdx9wVy6cLUmyzZSFFZ9tzsHZVWfMlawUeMU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQON_xzH2UD3VCe-Q4LiUetxYgZ0fOpeEOcfvxF5FRFoqQ&oe=6AE1E766"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZKgAIBoRBAcQ7kNvwHLDAjB&_nc_oc=AdpKFxChGJP4gf3WrObzAQtPZbkwk-740zspv4B6N6d07dSJTHZ_f50NGNDYwHUrCdc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOALEjtDVACWnY-R2VAEdGulWxNHr3RH8AU5LrBfnvBoA&oe=6AE1F15C"}, {"fil